WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:01:30.296
[ Watch on KissFlix.co ]

2
01:30.566 --> 01:31.551
=Tigers Sniff the Rose=

3
01:31.551 --> 01:33.560
(Based on the novel of the same name by Yiren Kuikui)

4
01:35.260 --> 01:38.940
=Episode 21=

5
01:51.140 --> 01:51.620
Your Highness.

6
01:59.700 --> 02:01.020
They let you in?

7
02:05.300 --> 02:06.180
Liyue...

8
02:07.940 --> 02:09.060
Where are Yusheng and the others?

9
02:11.540 --> 02:12.140
Gone.

10
02:14.420 --> 02:15.820
They're all gone.

11
02:26.060 --> 02:28.140
I want to go home.

12
03:04.180 --> 03:05.180
Now that you're in North Jing,

13
03:05.300 --> 03:06.700
you'd better follow our rules!

14
03:08.380 --> 03:08.820
Look at her!

15
03:08.820 --> 03:09.420
Give her the wine jug.

16
03:09.420 --> 03:10.460
You've scared the poor girl to tears!

17
03:12.900 --> 03:14.740
Go serve wine to my generals.

18
03:30.900 --> 03:33.500
Why do you keep hovering around Zaishi?

19
03:36.900 --> 03:37.300
Come here.

20
03:38.740 --> 03:39.500
Pour me a drink.

21
03:58.180 --> 03:58.900
On your knees.

22
04:01.700 --> 04:02.100
Kneel!

23
04:10.900 --> 04:11.940
You can't even pour wine?

24
04:13.020 --> 04:13.900
How stupid.

25
04:14.780 --> 04:16.500
Didn't anyone teach you growing up?

26
04:20.500 --> 04:21.380
You're right, General.

27
04:23.020 --> 04:23.580
Ever since I was little,

28
04:24.380 --> 04:25.340
I've had people serving me.

29
04:26.700 --> 04:27.780
Of course I don't know how to serve wine.

30
04:31.700 --> 04:32.260
That's easy.

31
04:43.780 --> 04:44.660
I'll teach you.

32
04:55.780 --> 04:56.860
Nice pour!

33
04:57.380 --> 04:58.980
- You made her cry! - I don't care who you are!

34
04:59.220 --> 05:01.300
Here in North Jing, you belong to General Meng!

35
05:02.820 --> 05:04.140
Scared now?

36
05:04.660 --> 05:05.740
I bet you are!

37
05:15.740 --> 05:17.260
- Nice pour! - Tastes good, doesn't it?

38
05:33.380 --> 05:33.740
Stop.

39
05:59.220 --> 06:00.460
So eager to die?

40
06:01.620 --> 06:03.660
You'd better go back to your room

41
06:04.580 --> 06:06.020
and pretend nothing happened.

42
06:07.580 --> 06:08.460
If he finds out

43
06:08.460 --> 06:10.140
you've been trying to kill yourself behind his back...

44
06:10.700 --> 06:11.940
Don't try to scare me with him.

45
06:14.420 --> 06:16.020
What can he do to me once I'm dead?

46
06:19.460 --> 06:21.140
You've got quite a mouth when you're talking to me.

47
06:22.780 --> 06:24.980
Who was so scared just now that she wanted to die?

48
06:26.300 --> 06:27.540
Death would be better than this.

49
06:29.540 --> 06:30.460
Why should I go on living?

50
06:34.460 --> 06:35.420
I've heard

51
06:36.460 --> 06:37.980
that generations of your Mu ancestors

52
06:38.460 --> 06:39.660
were great heroes.

53
06:41.820 --> 06:43.580
They built the Huai Empire.

54
06:44.980 --> 06:47.580
So how did their descendants become such cowards?

55
06:49.980 --> 06:51.260
Some princess you are.

56
06:52.060 --> 06:53.660
Always throwing fits and threatening suicide.

57
06:55.260 --> 06:57.100
Even the lowliest servants in North Jing

58
06:58.660 --> 07:00.420
have more backbone than you.

59
07:02.020 --> 07:04.060
No wonder my uncle looks down on you.

60
07:06.580 --> 07:07.420
I, Mu Wanyao,

61
07:09.460 --> 07:10.540
don't need his approval.

62
07:13.780 --> 07:14.980
Why do you think he asked to marry you?

63
07:15.860 --> 07:16.700
You know exactly what he's after.

64
07:18.980 --> 07:20.460
Instead of blaming everyone here,

65
07:21.820 --> 07:22.500
why not blame

66
07:22.500 --> 07:24.020
Yu Cheng'an, who sent you here?

67
07:26.980 --> 07:27.300
And of course,

68
07:28.460 --> 07:30.540
your spineless father, the Emperor.

69
07:30.820 --> 07:31.860
Don't you dare speak of my father!

70
07:34.020 --> 07:35.020
And you think you're any better?

71
07:35.620 --> 07:37.260
You serve him like a dog,

72
07:38.020 --> 07:39.020
always taking your cues from him.

73
07:39.860 --> 07:41.220
And he still doesn't trust you.

74
07:42.340 --> 07:43.700
You've got a filthy mouth.

75
07:44.500 --> 07:45.540
So why didn't you dare

76
07:46.300 --> 07:47.420
say a word at the banquet?

77
07:54.900 --> 07:56.700
Don't think I won't kill you!

78
07:58.500 --> 07:59.620
I don't want to live anyway.

79
08:00.500 --> 08:01.260
You're the one

80
08:02.620 --> 08:03.780
who keeps interfering.

81
08:12.260 --> 08:13.860
You're not worth arguing with.

82
08:23.700 --> 08:24.940
This belonged to the dead.

83
08:26.220 --> 08:27.620
It's bad luck to keep it on me.

84
08:29.260 --> 08:29.980
Let it be buried with its onwer.

85
08:47.180 --> 08:47.660
Your Highness.

86
08:48.420 --> 08:49.460
You're finally back.

87
08:50.780 --> 08:52.660
I thought you were going to leave me all alone.

88
08:53.900 --> 08:54.460
Don't be afraid.

89
08:56.820 --> 08:57.620
I'm back now.

90
09:11.980 --> 09:13.100
It's gone quiet.

91
09:18.380 --> 09:18.940
What?

92
09:19.580 --> 09:20.420
That bug.

93
09:22.900 --> 09:23.780
It's not moving anymore.

94
09:28.140 --> 09:29.180
Is it dead?

95
09:40.740 --> 09:41.300
Your Highness.

96
09:47.300 --> 09:47.820
Look.

97
09:49.700 --> 09:50.620
It got away.

98
09:50.620 --> 09:56.620
♪A daughter ventures forth, in the name her father gave♪

99
09:56.980 --> 10:02.100
♪Into savage lands, to tame tigers and slay wolves♪

100
10:02.100 --> 10:02.700
Chunhua.

101
10:06.300 --> 10:07.780
Do you remember the Rebellion of the Seven Military Governors?

102
10:10.220 --> 10:10.660
Your Highness,

103
10:11.460 --> 10:12.700
I was so young back then.

104
10:13.220 --> 10:14.460
I grew up in the countryside with my parents.

105
10:15.020 --> 10:16.060
I barely remember it.

106
10:18.820 --> 10:20.180
The year Sheng'an fell,

107
10:22.060 --> 10:22.780
I was nine.

108
10:24.340 --> 10:25.460
Father, Mother, and I

109
10:26.500 --> 10:27.660
fled to the Shu region for safety.

110
10:30.460 --> 10:31.740
Mother was always trying to comfort me,

111
10:33.500 --> 10:34.660
but deep down, I knew

112
10:36.980 --> 10:38.380
the world had changed.

113
10:38.380 --> 10:40.540
♪Nor wed for the sake of any kingdom♪

114
10:42.180 --> 10:43.940
I missed the swings in the Imperial Garden,

115
10:45.260 --> 10:46.980
and the lively crowds along the Qujiang River.

116
10:48.180 --> 10:49.300
I secretly wondered...

117
10:49.300 --> 10:52.340
♪With sacrificed innocence and a soul snowbound♪

118
10:52.380 --> 10:54.220
Would I ever get to return to Sheng'an?

119
10:55.060 --> 10:58.180
♪Cut down the crowd, strike down the proud gods♪

120
10:58.540 --> 10:59.660
But just a few years later,

121
11:00.980 --> 11:02.220
Sheng'an was recaptured.

122
11:03.260 --> 11:03.980
And I made it back.

123
11:05.780 --> 11:06.300
Chunhua,

124
11:07.060 --> 11:08.300
I've left Sheng'an before

125
11:09.540 --> 11:10.660
and made it back.

126
11:11.740 --> 11:12.380
This time,

127
11:13.780 --> 11:14.740
I can definitely do it again.

128
11:16.380 --> 11:18.540
♪Though this world is hard to cross, I'll lead you through♪

129
11:18.540 --> 11:20.420
We have to make it out alive.

130
11:20.420 --> 11:22.020
♪I dare face the unknown, with my sword in hand♪

131
11:22.020 --> 11:22.700
And go home.

132
11:23.620 --> 11:28.380
♪I'll guard my princess, and keep her tears at bay♪

133
13:31.500 --> 13:31.860
General.

134
13:32.580 --> 13:33.140
What is it?

135
13:33.700 --> 13:35.260
Meng Zaishi has been secretly training a unit

136
13:35.260 --> 13:36.140
for the past six months.

137
13:36.500 --> 13:37.460
They train day and night.

138
13:38.140 --> 13:38.620
I've heard

139
13:38.940 --> 13:40.540
each man can take on ten opponents.

140
13:41.100 --> 13:42.380
They specialize in ambushes and assassinations.

141
13:43.180 --> 13:44.460
Where did you hear this?

142
13:44.660 --> 13:45.900
Zuo He told me himself.

143
13:46.740 --> 13:47.580
He was rescued

144
13:47.660 --> 13:48.700
by Meng Zaishi on the battlefield.

145
13:49.020 --> 13:50.260
He's stayed by his side ever since,

146
13:50.380 --> 13:51.060
guarding him day and night.

147
13:52.100 --> 13:53.580
Meng Zaishi treats him like a brother

148
13:53.860 --> 13:55.060
and never keeps anything from him.

149
13:55.260 --> 13:56.700
Then assemble a squad of personal guards.

150
13:57.420 --> 13:59.180
Have them stand guard outside tonight's banquet.

151
13:59.740 --> 14:00.020
And remember,

152
14:00.940 --> 14:01.740
wait for my orders before acting.

153
14:02.180 --> 14:02.860
Yes, General.

154
14:25.060 --> 14:26.300
(With Bold, Majestic Strides)

155
14:31.140 --> 14:31.580
Come on!

156
14:31.940 --> 14:32.420
General.

157
14:33.420 --> 14:35.460
Let me pour a drink for all the generals today.

158
14:37.780 --> 14:38.140
Go on.

159
14:39.860 --> 14:40.300
Here's to you.

160
14:40.300 --> 14:42.020
- General, have some wine. - Come on!

161
14:42.300 --> 14:42.660
Fill it up!

162
14:43.060 --> 14:43.340
Here!

163
14:44.380 --> 14:44.780
Bottoms up!

164
14:45.300 --> 14:45.860
Let's have a drink!

165
14:47.060 --> 14:47.700
Here, General!

166
14:49.860 --> 14:50.580
Excellent wine!

167
14:51.700 --> 14:52.220
Again!

168
14:52.220 --> 14:53.060
Come on, let's drink! Cheers!

169
14:53.220 --> 14:54.140
Let's raise our cups!

170
14:54.260 --> 14:55.180
Pour some more!

171
14:55.260 --> 14:56.260
Come on, have some meat!

172
14:56.260 --> 14:56.980
Feed me.

173
15:01.140 --> 15:01.740
Wonderful!

174
15:02.380 --> 15:02.620
Good!

175
15:02.620 --> 15:03.020
Fill it up!

176
15:05.220 --> 15:06.260
You're in good spirits today, General.

177
15:06.500 --> 15:07.180
Have a few more drinks!

178
15:08.460 --> 15:08.780
Here!

179
15:09.340 --> 15:10.060
Let me toast you again!

180
15:17.020 --> 15:17.380
Fill it up!

181
15:19.820 --> 15:20.220
Come on!

182
15:22.180 --> 15:23.020
(Death to Traitors) Another toast to you!

183
15:23.340 --> 15:23.620
All right!

184
15:24.900 --> 15:25.180
Come on!

185
15:26.740 --> 15:27.340
Drink up!

186
15:28.140 --> 15:28.420
Good!

187
15:28.620 --> 15:28.900
Good!

188
15:38.100 --> 15:41.980
(With Bold, Majestic Strides)

189
15:46.540 --> 15:47.100
General,

190
15:47.860 --> 15:48.660
enjoy yourself.

191
15:49.740 --> 15:50.740
I'm getting tired.

192
15:51.580 --> 15:52.540
I'll go back to my room

193
15:53.020 --> 15:53.420
and wait for you.

194
15:58.060 --> 15:58.420
All right.

195
16:22.620 --> 16:23.020
Uncle,

196
16:24.020 --> 16:24.980
there's something I need to tell you.

197
16:25.940 --> 16:26.740
Let's hear it.

198
16:27.700 --> 16:29.260
Your 50th birthday is coming up.

199
16:30.420 --> 16:31.420
I've given it a lot of thought.

200
16:33.060 --> 16:34.740
You now command two military districts in North Jing.

201
16:35.460 --> 16:37.220
Fine weapons, prized horses, beautiful women...

202
16:37.900 --> 16:38.620
You have everything.

203
16:39.820 --> 16:40.580
I couldn't think

204
16:41.260 --> 16:42.540
of a suitable birthday gift.

205
16:43.100 --> 16:44.020
So?

206
16:47.100 --> 16:48.780
Lord Mengchang once had three thousand retainers.

207
16:50.860 --> 16:51.580
And now that you

208
16:52.900 --> 16:53.780
rule an entire region,

209
16:54.980 --> 16:56.380
the more talented men you have, the better.

210
16:57.500 --> 16:58.580
So six months ago,

211
16:58.820 --> 17:00.660
I began recruiting and training skilled fighters myself.

212
17:01.540 --> 17:02.780
My plan was to present them to you

213
17:03.020 --> 17:03.780
on your birthday

214
17:04.500 --> 17:05.460
to repay you for raising me.

215
17:06.140 --> 17:08.020
That's certainly an unusual birthday gift.

216
17:10.100 --> 17:11.980
But you've kept it secret for six months.

217
17:13.020 --> 17:14.980
Why couldn't you keep it

218
17:15.540 --> 17:16.860
to yourself any longer?

219
17:20.580 --> 17:21.780
I made the mistake of trusting the wrong man.

220
17:22.180 --> 17:23.580
Someone close to me has been spreading lies

221
17:24.940 --> 17:25.780
and making false accusations.

222
17:27.740 --> 17:28.860
I was worried,

223
17:29.620 --> 17:30.580
so I decided to tell you myself.

224
17:32.780 --> 17:33.900
I hope you'll see the truth, Uncle.

225
17:40.700 --> 17:41.900
If I, Meng Zaishi, ever betray you,

226
17:42.860 --> 17:43.700
may I end up like this sword!

227
18:25.420 --> 18:26.260
Get up.

228
18:32.700 --> 18:33.860
Zaishi,

229
18:35.300 --> 18:36.700
you're still such a child.

230
18:38.300 --> 18:40.180
If someone's just trying to turn me against you,

231
18:42.020 --> 18:43.420
why would I believe them?

232
18:52.100 --> 18:52.700
Go sit down.

233
19:11.020 --> 19:11.740
Thank you for tonight.

234
19:29.100 --> 19:29.660
Does it hurt?

235
19:31.580 --> 19:32.180
I'm a soldier.

236
19:32.900 --> 19:33.860
A little wound like this is nothing.

237
19:41.100 --> 19:42.260
Even a small wound

238
19:43.300 --> 19:44.300
can still hurt.

239
19:47.900 --> 19:49.260
Please don't let yourself get hurt again.

240
19:55.700 --> 19:56.940
What are you really after?

241
19:57.540 --> 19:58.580
I'm not after anything.

242
20:00.620 --> 20:02.220
I saw that you were hurt

243
20:03.580 --> 20:04.780
and felt sorry for you.

244
20:09.380 --> 20:10.620
I know what it's like to suffer. That's all.

245
20:13.940 --> 20:14.900
I'm just like you.

246
20:16.020 --> 20:16.860
When I'm wounded,

247
20:18.060 --> 20:18.740
it hurts me too.

248
20:46.540 --> 20:48.140
You risked sending me word tonight.

249
20:50.820 --> 20:52.060
If he finds out...

250
20:52.100 --> 20:53.180
Don't you understand?

251
20:57.260 --> 20:58.500
If he wants me dead,

252
20:59.900 --> 21:01.820
he can kill me whenever he feels like it.

253
21:02.540 --> 21:03.580
He doesn't need an excuse.

254
21:04.540 --> 21:05.740
It doesn't matter.

255
21:06.620 --> 21:07.940
It's not up to me anyway.

256
21:10.060 --> 21:10.900
Just like tonight.

257
21:12.100 --> 21:13.020
Whether you lived or died

258
21:14.180 --> 21:15.940
wasn't up to you either.

259
21:39.340 --> 21:40.140
You know,

260
21:42.140 --> 21:43.420
the day I arrived in the Central Circuit,

261
21:45.540 --> 21:46.820
you rode in to snatch me away.

262
21:48.980 --> 21:50.260
I'd never seen

263
21:51.460 --> 21:53.100
a man so tall and brave before.

264
22:03.860 --> 22:04.860
For a moment, I thought

265
22:06.700 --> 22:07.980
you were the man I was marrying.

266
22:21.220 --> 22:22.420
Who sent you?

267
22:22.860 --> 22:24.060
Why are you telling me all this?

268
22:29.740 --> 22:30.380
You think

269
22:32.220 --> 22:33.420
Meng Baiyu sent me

270
22:34.140 --> 22:35.180
to test your loyalty?

271
22:48.540 --> 22:49.260
Meng Zaishi,

272
22:50.740 --> 22:51.900
you were born to be a powerful leader.

273
22:53.060 --> 22:53.780
Don't tell me

274
22:55.620 --> 22:56.620
a man like you

275
22:58.100 --> 23:00.820
would spend his whole life risking his neck for him.

276
23:06.380 --> 23:07.260
Mu Wanyao,

277
23:08.900 --> 23:10.420
you've been putting on an act all this time

278
23:11.700 --> 23:13.420
just to stay alive.

279
23:17.300 --> 23:19.460
Aren't you afraid I'll tell my uncle what you said?

280
23:20.220 --> 23:20.660
Really?

281
23:23.980 --> 23:25.140
Would you dare tell him?

282
23:26.660 --> 23:27.860
Confirm his worst fears

283
23:28.780 --> 23:29.940
and bring his suspicions into the open?

284
23:31.780 --> 23:32.660
You share

285
23:33.100 --> 23:33.780
the Meng family name.

286
23:35.140 --> 23:36.060
And you command an army

287
23:37.300 --> 23:38.700
that's loyal to the Meng family.

288
23:38.700 --> 23:39.220
Shut up!

289
23:47.020 --> 23:48.140
You suddenly

290
23:49.580 --> 23:50.660
lashed out at me just now.

291
23:52.340 --> 23:53.020
Could it be

292
23:53.620 --> 23:54.980
I struck a nerve?

293
24:02.940 --> 24:03.860
My skin

294
24:05.060 --> 24:06.500
bruises easily.

295
24:07.900 --> 24:08.780
Just now,

296
24:09.300 --> 24:10.500
you grabbed me so hard.

297
24:11.020 --> 24:12.540
If Meng Baiyu notices

298
24:13.060 --> 24:14.740
these marks weren't left by him,

299
24:15.980 --> 24:16.940
what am I supposed to say?

300
24:18.820 --> 24:20.580
You really have a death wish.

301
24:21.940 --> 24:23.940
My uncle hates betrayal more than anything.

302
24:24.820 --> 24:25.940
If he ever finds out,

303
24:27.140 --> 24:27.820
death

304
24:28.900 --> 24:30.900
would be the best you could hope for.

305
24:35.300 --> 24:35.820
What about you?

306
24:38.860 --> 24:39.740
Do you hate betrayal too?

307
24:41.260 --> 24:43.260
I heard Zuo He betrayed you.

308
24:44.540 --> 24:45.580
You were like brothers.

309
24:48.900 --> 24:49.780
I'll kill him.

310
25:02.700 --> 25:03.180
Your Highness,

311
25:04.020 --> 25:05.740
we're surrounded by enemies.

312
25:06.380 --> 25:07.260
I don't think Meng Zaishi

313
25:07.260 --> 25:08.300
is any better than the others.

314
25:08.700 --> 25:09.780
Please don't count on him.

315
25:11.500 --> 25:13.780
You and I are trapped in this living hell.

316
25:14.820 --> 25:15.780
I'll try anything,

317
25:16.580 --> 25:17.780
as long as there's even the slightest chance

318
25:18.220 --> 25:19.060
we can make it out alive.

319
25:20.340 --> 25:21.100
Besides,

320
25:21.860 --> 25:23.380
Meng Zaishi gives us a real chance.

321
25:24.300 --> 25:25.460
It's a risk I have to take.

322
25:33.700 --> 25:34.740
If I get another chance,

323
25:36.060 --> 25:36.900
I'll keep trying.

324
25:37.900 --> 25:39.500
I know you're using yourself as bait.

325
25:40.300 --> 25:41.540
But after the way he treated you,

326
25:41.660 --> 25:42.860
it's clear he hasn't taken it.

327
25:43.180 --> 25:44.020
Why keep trying?

328
25:46.260 --> 25:47.660
Meng Baiyu is cruel and bloodthirsty.

329
25:47.980 --> 25:48.940
He makes no effort to hide his emotions.

330
25:50.220 --> 25:51.260
But Meng Zaishi

331
25:51.620 --> 25:52.700
is a different kind of beast.

332
25:53.740 --> 25:55.220
He thinks he's hiding it well,

333
25:55.820 --> 25:56.700
but I can see

334
25:57.060 --> 25:58.260
the wolf's tail

335
25:58.540 --> 25:59.580
beneath that dog's hide of his.

336
26:00.500 --> 26:01.540
He's meant for greater things.

337
26:02.260 --> 26:03.060
He won't be anyone's lapdog

338
26:04.060 --> 26:04.700
for long.

339
26:07.020 --> 26:08.220
As for what he's really thinking,

340
26:09.020 --> 26:09.740
I wasn't

341
26:10.100 --> 26:11.380
completely sure before.

342
26:12.340 --> 26:13.100
But today,

343
26:13.900 --> 26:15.060
he finally lost his composure.

344
26:15.860 --> 26:16.620
Now I know for sure.

345
26:17.020 --> 26:17.700
He's taken the bait.

346
26:19.500 --> 26:20.780
I bet he's

347
26:21.340 --> 26:22.540
tossing and turning right now.

348
26:31.260 --> 26:31.580
Leave us.

349
26:32.900 --> 26:33.420
Are you insane?

350
26:34.820 --> 26:35.900
How could you come here on your own?

351
26:38.180 --> 26:39.020
These past few days,

352
26:39.740 --> 26:41.420
I've sent Chunhua to fetch you several times,

353
26:41.900 --> 26:42.860
but you never came.

354
26:43.540 --> 26:44.660
So I had to come myself.

355
26:44.940 --> 26:45.780
Nobody saw you, did they?

356
26:46.220 --> 26:47.260
So what if they did?

357
26:48.780 --> 26:50.180
Meng Baiyu favors me now.

358
26:50.500 --> 26:52.220
I've visited plenty of his men's homes.

359
26:53.180 --> 26:54.500
As long as I stay in the Central Circuit,

360
26:54.580 --> 26:55.740
he lets me go wherever I please.

361
27:01.180 --> 27:02.380
What I suggested the other day...

362
27:03.140 --> 27:04.500
Won't you even consider it?

363
27:06.380 --> 27:07.220
Your plan

364
27:07.660 --> 27:08.580
would get a lot of people killed.

365
27:09.220 --> 27:11.020
And how many people have you killed on the battlefield?

366
27:13.900 --> 27:15.060
You clearly don't care about that.

367
27:20.620 --> 27:21.060
Fine.

368
27:23.900 --> 27:24.860
I guess I misjudged you.

369
27:27.420 --> 27:28.060
So what now?

370
27:29.300 --> 27:31.060
Going to find another man to seduce?

371
27:33.140 --> 27:34.420
How can you say that?

372
27:35.860 --> 27:36.820
You know how I've treated you.

373
27:38.140 --> 27:39.700
Don't tell me you haven't noticed.

374
27:43.540 --> 27:44.500
I know you value loyalty

375
27:45.300 --> 27:45.980
and don't want to act.

376
27:46.980 --> 27:48.220
But I can't bear

377
27:48.580 --> 27:50.060
another day sharing a bed

378
27:50.060 --> 27:50.980
with a man I don't love.

379
27:56.460 --> 27:57.060
Meng Zaishi,

380
27:58.260 --> 27:59.380
if you won't act for your own sake,

381
28:00.420 --> 28:01.980
then help Chunhua and me escape.

382
28:04.500 --> 28:05.660
What makes you think

383
28:06.540 --> 28:07.420
I'd help you?

384
28:08.300 --> 28:09.340
The fact that I'm standing here.

385
28:11.100 --> 28:11.740
It means

386
28:12.780 --> 28:14.180
you never told Meng Baiyu

387
28:14.180 --> 28:15.060
what I said that day.

388
28:15.900 --> 28:16.540
That tells me

389
28:17.700 --> 28:19.420
you do care whether I live or die.

390
28:22.020 --> 28:22.740
After tomorrow,

391
28:23.700 --> 28:24.780
we'll have our chance.

392
28:25.660 --> 28:26.380
What have you found out?

393
28:27.980 --> 28:28.500
Tomorrow,

394
28:29.620 --> 28:30.780
Meng Baiyu is taking his troops

395
28:31.460 --> 28:32.500
to inspect the border.

396
28:33.860 --> 28:35.180
He'll be gone for ten days, maybe two weeks.

397
28:42.900 --> 28:43.980
If I let you go,

398
28:45.380 --> 28:46.340
there's too much at stake.

399
28:47.780 --> 28:49.740
It's a long way. If you never return...

400
28:55.940 --> 28:56.900
What's in it for me?

401
29:11.420 --> 29:13.740
What would you like in return, General?

402
29:27.540 --> 29:29.220
Your belt seems to be

403
29:30.260 --> 29:31.740
missing a silk handkerchief.

404
29:33.780 --> 29:34.900
If Meng Baiyu

405
29:35.580 --> 29:37.380
found it beside my pillow,

406
29:38.980 --> 29:40.180
should I tell him

407
29:40.620 --> 29:41.380
it's yours?

408
29:44.660 --> 29:45.780
How dare you threaten me?

409
29:46.380 --> 29:47.780
You won't kill Meng Baiyu,

410
29:48.740 --> 29:49.860
and you won't help me get back to Sheng'an.

411
29:50.220 --> 29:50.860
What choice do I have?

412
29:51.900 --> 29:54.460
Am I supposed to grow old with him here?

413
29:55.020 --> 29:55.780
You really think

414
29:55.780 --> 29:57.660
you can blackmail me with a handkerchief?

415
29:58.540 --> 30:00.540
If he believes we're having an affair,

416
30:02.460 --> 30:04.100
which of us do you think

417
30:06.140 --> 30:07.420
will suffer more?

418
30:07.900 --> 30:09.180
Then I'll make sure to embellish the story

419
30:09.740 --> 30:10.780
and take you down with me.

420
30:12.940 --> 30:14.780
If I can't return to Sheng'an,

421
30:16.020 --> 30:17.900
my life's already over anyway.

422
30:19.100 --> 30:19.900
But you, General,

423
30:20.740 --> 30:21.580
have a bright future ahead of you.

424
30:22.460 --> 30:24.140
If you go down with someone as good as dead,

425
30:24.540 --> 30:25.220
I'd call that a fair trade.

426
30:35.420 --> 30:37.060
There's no doubt about it. You're pregnant.

427
30:37.180 --> 30:37.940
I'm certain.

428
30:38.340 --> 30:39.220
Congratulations, my lady.

429
30:48.660 --> 30:49.460
Why?

430
31:15.940 --> 31:17.340
(Those mercury-laced pills...)

431
31:18.060 --> 31:19.420
(I've taken them every three days.)

432
31:19.820 --> 31:20.860
(I've never missed a dose.)

433
31:21.980 --> 31:24.100
(Why would heaven play such a cruel trick on me?)

434
31:42.340 --> 31:43.300
You're dying.

435
31:48.820 --> 31:50.020
But I want to live.

436
31:50.780 --> 31:51.700
So you came to me

437
31:52.820 --> 31:54.100
because you think I can save you?

438
31:56.660 --> 31:57.660
Please, General Meng.

439
31:58.260 --> 31:59.420
Save Her Highness!

440
32:00.660 --> 32:01.580
I'm begging you.

441
32:03.140 --> 32:04.100
I thought

442
32:06.500 --> 32:07.900
you'd rather have me alive

443
32:10.540 --> 32:12.180
than dead.

444
32:12.900 --> 32:13.620
The fact that I care about you

445
32:14.140 --> 32:15.060
might save your life.

446
32:16.180 --> 32:16.860
Or...

447
32:17.940 --> 32:19.380
it might just get you killed.

448
32:23.260 --> 32:24.460
But you're lucky tonight.

449
32:27.420 --> 32:28.260
My feelings for you

450
32:30.900 --> 32:31.820
will save your life.

451
32:36.620 --> 32:38.100
Then I'm grateful for your feelings

452
32:40.060 --> 32:41.380
and for my good luck.

453
32:49.540 --> 32:50.940
This antidote is made from jade poria.

454
32:51.900 --> 32:52.780
I happen to have one pill.

455
32:55.460 --> 32:56.220
You're very lucky.

456
32:59.980 --> 33:01.780
I've heard of that prescription you mentioned.

457
33:04.060 --> 33:06.220
But once you take this antidote,

458
33:07.660 --> 33:09.060
it won't just save your life.

459
33:13.260 --> 33:15.060
It'll save your unborn child, too.

460
33:43.100 --> 33:43.620
Your Highness.

461
33:45.140 --> 33:45.860
Mu Wanyao!

462
33:47.060 --> 33:48.020
Are you trying to get yourself killed?

463
33:48.960 --> 33:50.780
♪Cold as a blade, yet peerless as a bloom♪

464
33:50.780 --> 33:51.460
I do.

465
33:52.680 --> 33:54.340
♪Who dares make me bow down in the dust?♪

466
33:54.340 --> 33:55.180
But tonight,

467
33:57.420 --> 33:58.980
only one of us gets to live.

468
34:00.500 --> 34:02.420
♪If the road is blocked, I'll fight my way through♪

469
34:02.420 --> 34:03.740
And that will be me.

470
34:03.740 --> 34:06.220
♪Cut down the crowd, strike down the proud gods♪

471
34:06.540 --> 34:07.300
Good luck.

472
34:07.300 --> 34:09.460
♪Break through Hell's gates♪

473
34:10.140 --> 34:14.180
♪If I could meet my former self again♪

474
34:14.340 --> 34:17.140
♪Don't be afraid, I'll become a demon for you♪

475
34:17.180 --> 34:23.420
♪Through fire, I'll turn the dark towers bright as day for you♪

476
34:24.060 --> 34:27.860
♪Though this world is hard to cross, I'll lead you through♪

477
34:27.980 --> 34:31.060
♪I dare face the unknown, with my sword in hand♪

478
34:31.300 --> 34:34.970
♪Slay wolves, tame tigers, breach the city gates♪

479
34:34.970 --> 34:40.180
♪Slay wolves, tame tigers, breach the city gates♪

480
34:43.300 --> 34:43.740
Mother...

481
34:47.620 --> 34:48.380
Take me...

482
34:49.140 --> 34:50.300
Take me home.

483
34:50.300 --> 34:54.280
♪A tooth for a tooth; A scar for a scar♪

484
34:54.280 --> 34:57.460
♪A tooth for a tooth; A scar for a scar♪

485
34:58.220 --> 35:01.620
♪One song of slaughter follows another♪

486
35:04.900 --> 35:05.340
Your Highness!

487
35:16.900 --> 35:18.260
Looks like my gamble paid off.

488
35:23.980 --> 35:25.180
How long was I unconscious?

489
35:26.660 --> 35:27.660
Two days and two nights.

490
35:29.260 --> 35:31.900
The Military Headquarters' physician came to check your pulse yesterday.

491
35:32.940 --> 35:33.740
I couldn't stop him.

492
35:35.420 --> 35:37.060
Then he'll find out soon enough.

493
35:38.780 --> 35:39.420
Chunhua,

494
35:42.140 --> 35:43.100
take all this bedding

495
35:43.820 --> 35:44.620
and these bloodstained clothes

496
35:45.140 --> 35:46.020
and burn them.

497
35:48.540 --> 35:49.860
Help me wash up and get dressed.

498
36:24.380 --> 36:24.820
Darling...

499
36:26.140 --> 36:26.580
Darling...

500
36:28.100 --> 36:29.140
I've failed you.

501
36:32.100 --> 36:33.060
You worthless wretch!

502
36:33.460 --> 36:35.220
Even animals can give birth!

503
36:36.020 --> 36:37.460
You're worse than an animal!

504
36:44.140 --> 36:46.020
If I hadn't fallen for those lies back then,

505
36:46.980 --> 36:49.620
I'd never have spared your worthless life!

506
36:53.580 --> 36:54.140
Darling...

507
37:01.380 --> 37:02.220
Darling...

508
37:03.860 --> 37:04.860
Darling...

509
37:07.420 --> 37:08.220
Darling...

510
37:09.980 --> 37:10.580
Darling...

511
37:12.660 --> 37:13.580
The pregnancy was unstable.

512
37:14.580 --> 37:15.700
I'm devastated too.

513
37:17.100 --> 37:18.140
I can still have...

514
37:20.460 --> 37:21.420
What future?

515
37:22.540 --> 37:24.380
You think you still have a future?

516
37:25.140 --> 37:26.620
I'm the good omen of Huai!

517
37:26.620 --> 37:27.460
Nonsense!

518
37:27.980 --> 37:29.260
You're a liar!

519
37:29.660 --> 37:30.980
So is your father!

520
37:30.980 --> 37:32.700
And Yu Cheng'an's the biggest liar of all!

521
37:33.140 --> 37:34.100
Once I've killed you,

522
37:34.100 --> 37:35.940
I'll march my army south to Sheng'an

523
37:36.180 --> 37:37.980
and wipe every last one of you out!

524
39:17.980 --> 39:18.580
You're safe now.

525
39:26.940 --> 39:27.860
You were right.

526
39:29.020 --> 39:30.060
I survived.

527
39:40.900 --> 39:42.300
But my uncle came back tonight.

528
39:43.620 --> 39:44.420
How did you get out?

529
39:51.420 --> 39:52.580
I have a very special gift for you.

530
39:55.660 --> 39:56.300
What have you done?

531
39:57.100 --> 39:57.860
Where's Meng Baiyu?

532
39:58.580 --> 39:59.900
He's in my room, of course.

533
40:01.980 --> 40:02.780
Though by now,

534
40:04.700 --> 40:06.300
he's probably dead.

535
40:12.780 --> 40:13.420
You did this?

536
40:14.620 --> 40:15.300
He's dead.

537
40:17.620 --> 40:18.220
For now,

538
40:19.020 --> 40:20.860
only heaven, you, and I know.

539
40:21.740 --> 40:22.780
No one else knows.

540
40:25.140 --> 40:26.020
Why tell me?

541
40:26.900 --> 40:27.860
With Meng Baiyu dead,

542
40:29.100 --> 40:29.980
you're not the only one

543
40:30.580 --> 40:31.820
who wants his position.

544
40:33.020 --> 40:33.580
Soon,

545
40:34.860 --> 40:36.300
all of the Central Circuit will be in mourning.

546
40:37.460 --> 40:39.580
What will become of the Military Headquarters?

547
40:40.500 --> 40:41.620
Who will take his place?

548
40:42.660 --> 40:43.500
We'll have our answers

549
40:44.060 --> 40:45.020
within a few days.

550
40:47.020 --> 40:47.860
Speed is everything in war.

551
40:49.700 --> 40:50.340
Meng Zaishi,

552
40:52.660 --> 40:53.420
you're the only one

553
40:53.860 --> 40:55.220
I can count on now.

554
41:05.100 --> 41:05.700
Mu Wanyao,

555
41:07.500 --> 41:09.260
my temper is no better than Meng Baiyu's.

556
41:11.300 --> 41:12.140
If you dare lie to me,

557
41:12.140 --> 41:13.340
you're dead. Got it?

558
41:15.580 --> 41:16.300
Meng Zaishi,

559
41:17.260 --> 41:18.260
why would I lie to you?

560
41:19.660 --> 41:20.460
In all of North Jing,

561
41:21.100 --> 41:21.740
who else

562
41:22.460 --> 41:23.780
would help me but you?

563
41:25.140 --> 41:25.900
Meng Zaishi,

564
41:26.900 --> 41:28.100
I'm putting

565
41:28.860 --> 41:30.140
my life in your hands.

566
41:38.260 --> 41:38.980
Right now,

567
41:39.820 --> 41:40.980
his body is in my room.

568
41:42.820 --> 41:43.780
What should I do?

569
41:48.500 --> 41:49.620
By the Central Circuit custom,

570
41:51.900 --> 41:52.820
a wife who bears no children

571
41:54.300 --> 41:55.780
must be buried with her husband.

572
41:58.260 --> 41:58.980
Unless...

573
42:00.820 --> 42:02.100
you become the new military governor.

574
42:04.060 --> 42:04.620
Meng Zaishi,

575
42:05.260 --> 42:06.060
marry me.

576
42:10.140 --> 42:10.940
Answer me.

577
42:12.620 --> 42:13.580
I'll marry you.

578
42:18.780 --> 42:19.780
I'll wait for you right here.

579
42:21.060 --> 42:22.060
I'll be waiting for good news.

580
42:23.700 --> 42:24.380
Give me three days.

581
42:26.460 --> 42:27.540
I'll take control of the Central Circuit.

582
42:28.780 --> 42:30.540
Once everything's settled, I'll come back for you.

583
42:31.780 --> 42:32.300
All right.

584
42:34.660 --> 42:35.380
I'll wait for you.

585
43:03.260 --> 43:04.060
This hairpin

586
43:07.020 --> 43:07.980
will be our token of love.

587
43:16.340 --> 43:16.780
All right.

588
43:17.740 --> 43:18.900
Be careful, Young General.

589
43:19.460 --> 43:19.740
No. I mean...

590
43:22.020 --> 43:22.620
General.

591
43:52.300 --> 43:53.220
The fish tally is gone!

592
43:57.340 --> 43:58.940
Mu Wanyao!

593
44:43.380 --> 44:44.500
I'm here on the governor's orders

594
44:45.220 --> 44:46.900
to buy medicine for his wife outside the city.

595
44:49.220 --> 44:50.340
Here's the general's fish tally.

596
44:54.900 --> 44:55.500
Let them through!

597
45:10.140 --> 45:10.620
Your Highness,

598
45:11.260 --> 45:12.140
can you keep going?

599
45:12.660 --> 45:13.220
I'll be fine.

600
45:13.900 --> 45:15.780
What if the young general realizes you tricked him

601
45:16.060 --> 45:17.100
and sends men after us?

602
45:17.380 --> 45:18.260
Meng Baiyu has just died.

603
45:19.020 --> 45:21.380
All of North Jing will soon be in chaos.

604
45:22.100 --> 45:24.300
For Meng Zaishi to take his uncle's place,

605
45:25.020 --> 45:26.020
win the army's loyalty

606
45:26.180 --> 45:26.980
and bring every faction under his control,

607
45:27.420 --> 45:28.860
it'll take more than a few days.

608
45:29.980 --> 45:31.340
Even if he discovers I'm gone,

609
45:32.780 --> 45:35.020
he can't afford to get sidetracked chasing me.

610
45:36.060 --> 45:36.940
What he wants more than a woman

611
45:37.820 --> 45:39.740
is the governor's seat.

612
45:40.100 --> 45:41.060
And a witness who's disappeared...

613
45:41.700 --> 45:42.980
By the time things settle at the Military Headquarters,

614
45:43.740 --> 45:44.820
we'll be long gone from the Central Circuit.

615
45:49.260 --> 45:49.700
(Goodbye,)

616
45:50.340 --> 45:50.780
(North Jing.)

617
46:06.700 --> 46:11.380
(Next Episode Preview)

618
46:11.940 --> 46:12.740
You really care about him, huh?

619
46:13.660 --> 46:14.580
You came to see me

620
46:15.180 --> 46:15.940
without first attending court.

621
46:16.420 --> 46:17.380
That's a serious offense itself.

622
46:17.820 --> 46:19.340
If someone gets killed in my residence,

623
46:19.540 --> 46:20.740
do you think you'll make it back to North Jing?

624
46:21.100 --> 46:21.740
Who's there?

625
46:22.380 --> 46:22.940
It's me.

626
46:28.560 --> 46:31.853
♪Be the ferry where you wait for the sun♪

627
46:34.538 --> 46:39.454
♪Be the blue silk that catches your tears♪

628
46:41.648 --> 46:47.493
♪Be the sleeve we held, worn by dust and years♪

629
46:47.993 --> 46:53.219
♪Let's conspire to grow old together♪

630
46:55.988 --> 47:00.779
♪Let me be a captive beast bound by the same lock as you♪

631
47:01.615 --> 47:07.694
♪- Through trails of mud and blood; - let grief drown in your eyes♪

632
47:09.495 --> 47:12.645
♪Soar with the wind; plunge into hellfire as one♪

633
47:12.645 --> 47:14.293
♪Burning bright as a song♪

634
47:14.345 --> 47:18.069
♪See how roses and green bamboo enchant♪

635
47:18.447 --> 47:23.113
♪Be the vow I make with all my heart♪

636
47:23.732 --> 47:27.773
♪If we say forever, then forever it shall be♪

637
47:28.264 --> 47:30.379
♪Not a single hour less♪

638
47:30.419 --> 47:37.365
♪However deep the snow, I'll wait if you're there♪

639
47:38.128 --> 47:41.581
♪We'll be gods above, or wandering souls♪

640
47:41.761 --> 47:44.906
♪In heaven or the underworld, you're all I need♪

641
47:45.345 --> 47:51.982
♪If we can stay, let's return to the village of our first meeting♪

642
47:52.379 --> 47:54.417
♪- May time be free of fear; - boats rock♪

643
47:54.417 --> 47:56.893
♪- May time be free of pain; - lights fade, seasons turn♪

644
47:56.931 --> 47:59.400
♪You're the only one I need♪

645
47:59.604 --> 48:06.491
♪Sharp winds or fierce rain, nothing can break us♪

646
48:06.803 --> 48:10.074
♪Be mine in this world; be mine in this life♪

647
48:10.379 --> 48:13.552
♪My last untouched innocence♪

648
48:13.876 --> 48:17.302
♪If only we could return to the village where we first met♪

649
48:17.535 --> 48:20.760
♪Stay by me; help me forget the frozen dream of last night♪

650
48:21.091 --> 48:27.887
♪Fireflies glow, flowers kiss our lips; just us, through dawn and dusk♪

651
48:28.256 --> 48:30.318
♪- May time be free of fear; - boats rock♪

652
48:30.319 --> 48:32.822
♪- May time be free of pain; - lights fade, seasons turn♪

653
48:32.869 --> 48:35.207
♪You're the only one I need♪

654
48:35.438 --> 48:42.273
♪By your side, through joy and pain, is that eternity?♪

655
48:42.622 --> 48:44.240
♪Till fireworks flood the town♪

656
48:44.370 --> 48:46.166
♪Till the lake is still and clear♪

